Bonus Task: Quantum Computing Simulation (Extra 10%)

IBM Qiskit – Simple Quantum Circuit


from qiskit import QuantumCircuit, Aer, execute
qc = QuantumCircuit(2)
qc.h(0)
qc.cx(0, 1)
qc.measure_all()
simulator = Aer.get_backend('qasm_simulator')
result = execute(qc, simulator, shots=1024).result()
print(result.get_counts())




Application: Drug Discovery Optimization

Quantum computers simulate molecular interactions faster than classical methods. Combined with AI, this enables rapid screening of drug candidates, reducing R&D time and improving outcomes in precision medicine.
